<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60187" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρουν-ός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spring, well head</i>, whence
			streams (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηγαί</span>) issue, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				22.147
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				208
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείμαρροι ποταμοὶ . . κρουνῶν ἐκ
					μεγάλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.454
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				13.63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				530.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				3.1177.290
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρουνοὶ κρηναίου ποτοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. αἵματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					790
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hec.</u>
				568
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρουνοὶ Ἁφαίστοιο</span>
			<i>streams</i> of lava from Etna, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.25
			</span></i>; of <i>streaming</i> perspiration, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				7.85
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				316.3
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>torrent of words</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαρρῶν τὸν κ. ἀφίει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					1005
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>watercourse</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				5.3.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>spout, nozzle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Spir.</u>
				2.25
			</span></i>, al.</div>
